yugabyte-db/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/deployments","created_at":"2017-10-05T21:56:00Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T01:01:53Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-13T05:03:31Z","git_url":"git://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db","homepage":"https://www.yugabyte.com","size":908218,"stargazers_count":9958,"watchers_count":9958,"language":"C","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":1201,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":7608,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["cloud-native","cpp","database","distributed-database","distributed-sql","distributed-sql-database","high-performance","kubernetes","multi-cloud","multi-region","scale-out","sql"],"visibility":"public","forks":1201,"open_issues":7608,"watchers":9958,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-11068](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-11068)\r\n### Description\n\nI'm evaluating YugabyteDB v2.21 and facing a bug that returns a wrong record with a ORDER clause.\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ psql -h localhost -p 5433 -U yugabyte\r\npsql (14.11 (Homebrew), server 11.2-YB-2.21.0.0-b0)\r\nType \"help\" for help.\r\n\r\nyugabyte=# \\d \"int_test_storage_mul_ckey_BOOLEAN\".\"BOOLEAN_DESC_BOOLEAN_ASC\"\r\nTable \"int_test_storage_mul_ckey_BOOLEAN.BOOLEAN_DESC_BOOLEAN_ASC\"\r\n Column |  Type   | Collation | Nullable | Default \r\n--------+---------+-----------+----------+---------\r\n pkey   | integer |           | not null | \r\n ckey1  | boolean |           | not null | \r\n ckey2  | boolean |           | not null | \r\n col    | integer |           |          | \r\nIndexes:\r\n    \"BOOLEAN_DESC_BOOLEAN_ASC_pkey\" PRIMARY KEY, lsm (pkey HASH, ckey1 ASC, ckey2 ASC)\r\n    \"int_test_storage_mul_ckey_BOOLEAN.BOOLEAN_DESC_BOOLEAN_ASC_clus\" UNIQUE, lsm (pkey ASC, ckey1 DESC, ckey2 ASC)\r\n\r\nyugabyte=# SELECT * FROM \"int_test_storage_mul_ckey_BOOLEAN\".\"BOOLEAN_DESC_BOOLEAN_ASC\";\r\n pkey | ckey1 | ckey2 | col \r\n------+-------+-------+-----\r\n    1 | f     | f     |   1\r\n    1 | f     | t     |   1\r\n    1 | t     | f     |   1\r\n    1 | t     | t     |   1\r\n(4 rows)\r\n\r\nyugabyte=# SELECT * FROM \"int_test_storage_mul_ckey_BOOLEAN\".\"BOOLEAN_DESC_BOOLEAN_ASC\" WHERE \"pkey\"=1 AND \"ckey1\"=true AND \"ckey2\">false AND \"ckey2\"<=false;\r\n pkey | ckey1 | ckey2 | col \r\n------+-------+-------+-----\r\n(0 rows)           <<<<<<<<<<<<<< Correct\r\n\r\nyugabyte=# SELECT * FROM \"int_test_storage_mul_ckey_BOOLEAN\".\"BOOLEAN_DESC_BOOLEAN_ASC\" WHERE \"pkey\"=1 AND \"ckey1\"=true AND \"ckey2\">false AND \"ckey2\"<=false ORDER BY \"ckey1\" ASC,\"ckey2\" DESC;\r\n pkey | ckey1 | ckey2 | col \r\n------+-------+-------+-----\r\n    1 | t     | f     |   1\r\n(1 row)           <<<<<<<<<<<<<< Wrong\r\n```\r\n\r\nIn the above case, with `ORDER BY \"ckey1\" ASC,\"ckey2\" DESC` YugabyteDB returns the wrong record while it expectedly returns no record w/o the ORDER clause.\n\n### Issue Type\n\nkind/bug\n\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\n\n- [X] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\n\n[DB-11068]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-11068?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/22140/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/22140/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]